<title>HONG KONG: Guangzhou Inv moves forward on spinoff.</title>
<headline>Guangzhou Inv moves forward on spinoff.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd has made &quot;an advance booking&quot; of an application to the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong for listing of its infrastructure unit, the company said in a statement published on Thursday.</p>
<p>The spinoff will hold the company's highway and bridge projects in China's Guangdong Province, it said.</p>
<p>The stock exchange has yet to consider the application and no final decision can be reached at present on the market capitalisation, timing and pricing of the proposed listing, the company said. Guangzhou Investment shares rose HK$0.025 to HK$2.60 around midday. -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2743 6370</p>
</text>
